      "instance_name": "sleepyhead_term",
      "label": "Sleepyhead",
      "description": "A colloquial term used to describe someone who is lazy, unproductive, or overly sleepy. In this meme, it is used in a mocking and condescending manner to imply the elderly Black man is lazy or unalert, reinforcing the stereotype of Black people as lazy.",
